# Browser-test screenshots.
#
# Regenerated by every e2e run and committed for months, at ~1 MB each
# (fullPage + deviceScaleFactor 2). They accumulated to 68 MB of git history -
# more than the entire rest of the repository - and blew the workspace
# snapshot budget, which silently dropped 133 files.
#
# They are DEBUG OUTPUT, not source. Any run regenerates them, and a stale
# screenshot in the repo is worse than none because it shows a UI that no
# longer exists. Kept on disk for inspecting the current run; never committed.
e2e/shots/

# Live/sandbox credential files - never commit
.env-*
!.env-*.example

# Scratch scripts
scratch/

